# Source manga. Never commit artwork you do not own the rights to - Kage ships
# no third-party manga, and a public repo is publication.
*.cbz
*.cbr
*.rar
*.zip
Uzumaki*/
Uzumaki*
hokusai*
sample_manga/

# Packaged builds
dist/

# Locally installed agent skills. A SKILL.md is instructions an agent follows, so it is
# not something to hand contributors without review - and a skill is usually about how
# one person works, not about Kage. A backtesting-frameworks skill was installed here by
# accident and would have shipped a quantitative-trading guide in a manga animation
# repo. General-purpose skills belong in ~/.claude/skills/ instead.
#
# Project settings are deliberately NOT ignored: .claude/settings.json is shared
# configuration and should be reviewable in a pull request if one is ever added.
.claude/skills/

# Brainstorming companion scratch. Holds copies of panel artwork, which must never
# be committed - see the manga rules above.
.superpowers/
